{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17733","headline":"送裴中丞出使 · 杨巨源","name":"送裴中丞出使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一清淮甸假朝纲，金印初迎细柳黄。\n辞阙天威和雨露，出关春色避风霜。\n龙韬何必陈三略，虎旅由来肃万方。\n宣谕生灵真重任，回轩应问石渠郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}